t away?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529250/extras/59505b1ba94a0d5255b7add5c12e5b04.poster.avif?t=1718353941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529250/extras/59505b1ba94a0d5255b7add5c12e5b04.webm?t=1718353941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529250/extras/59505b1ba94a0d5255b7add5c12e5b04.mp4?t=1718353941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
